OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash between
OL,4,Amotorbike and tractor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a crash between a
OL,7,Fmotorbike and tractor, police have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FThe crash happened at about 16:55 BST
OL,11,Fon Sunday on Nadder Lane, near South
OL,12,FMolton, said Devon and Cornwall Police.
OL,14,FThe crash involved a blue BMW S1000
OL,15,Fmotorbike and a green John Deere
OL,16,Ftractor, police said.
OL,18,FOfficers said the rider of the
OL,19,Fmotorbike, a local man in his 20s, died
OL,20,Fat the scene while the driver of the
OL,21,Ftractor was not hurt.
